msgstr "![최적화의 중요한 요소들을 나타내는 다이어그램으로, barren plateau, gradient vs gradient-free optimizer, bootstrapping을 포함합니다.](/learning/images/courses/variational-algorithm-design/optimization-loops/optimization-workflow.svg)\n"

